  "worked_solution": "The formula for the derivative of $arccsc$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccscx)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{\u2032}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sqrt{x}-2arccscx) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}-2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccscx) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}-2(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}+\\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
